Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Add aggregate Philips boundary diagnostics

Replace per-sample Philips probe output with aggregate-only diagnostics: track max delta, per-phase counts, mean absolute delta, and phase maxima while keeping the audio path close to normal.

Also update the RAW capture docs/current-pass notes to reflect the PHILIPS I2S boundary spike investigation and the reduced logging strategy.
